#question(title: [Parity])[
  #set text(size: 13pt)

  + Write down the definition of odd function
    and even function. (Assume the domain is
    $RR$.)
     #v(0.2cm)
  + Let $f$ be an odd, $C^oo$ function. What
    can you say about its Maclaurin series?
    What if $f$ is even?
     #v(0.2cm)

     #emph[Hint:] Think of $sin$ and $cos$.
     #v(0.2cm)
  + Prove it.
     #v(0.2cm)

     #emph[Hints:]
     - Use the general formula for the
       Maclaurin series.
     - If $h$ is odd then what is $h(0)$?
     - The derivative of an even function is
       ...?
     - The derivative of an odd function is
       ...?
]
